      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, but i still feel like it's hard to separate the two. like, if originalism ends up giving conservative results most of the time, isn't it kinda hard to argue it's actually neutral? what's the main counter-argument to the idea that it's just a tool for modern conservatism?",
